BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_99a1af16-58cd-3f11-a877-c43d3c8e5d78.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
